[I] PolicyKit helper for CUPS printer administration

[T] cups-pk-helper is a PolicyKit helper that lets applications configure CUPS
[T] printers with fine-grained privileges, avoiding the need to run the whole
[T] printer administration UI as root.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/cups-pk-helper/cups-pk-helper

